Ctype: character type checks (ctype_digit, ctype_alpha, ...) by the
current locale.

The module ctype of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/ctype.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/ctype.
